{"id":1677,"date":"2015-10-27T18:29:39","date_gmt":"2015-10-28T01:29:39","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?p=1677"},"modified":"2018-08-15T07:12:05","modified_gmt":"2018-08-15T07:12:05","slug":"ccra-october-24-breakfast-pictures-and-meeting-summary","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/27\/ccra-october-24-breakfast-pictures-and-meeting-summary\/","title":{"rendered":"CCRA October 24 Breakfast Pictures and meeting summary"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Our CCRA breakfast had 20 people show up which was a good turnout.<\/strong><\/p>\n<div id=\"attachment_345311\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345311\" data-attachment-id=\"345311\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/27\/ccra-october-24-breakfast-pictures-and-meeting-summary\/2015-10-24-09-16-34\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?fit=4128%2C2322\" data-orig-size=\"4128,2322\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.2&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;SM-N900T&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1445678194&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;4.13&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2015-10-24-09.16.34\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Vicki, N6KLS was back in rare form running the meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Vicki, N6KLS was back in rare form running the meeting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?fit=300%2C169\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?fit=600%2C338\" class=\"size-large wp-image-345311\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?resize=600%2C338\" alt=\"Vicki, N6KLS was back in rare form running the meeting.\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?resize=1024%2C576 1024w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?resize=300%2C169 300w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?resize=768%2C432 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?w=1200 1200w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.16.34.jpg?w=1800 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><p id=\"caption-attachment-345311\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Vicki, N6KLS was back in rare form running the meeting.<\/p><\/div>\n<div id=\"attachment_345310\" style=\"width: 610px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-345310\" data-attachment-id=\"345310\" data-permalink=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/27\/ccra-october-24-breakfast-pictures-and-meeting-summary\/2015-10-24-09-17-12\/\" data-orig-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?fit=4128%2C2322\" data-orig-size=\"4128,2322\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;2.2&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;SM-N900T&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;1445678232&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;4.13&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"2015-10-24-09.17.12\" data-image-description=\"&lt;p&gt;Earle, KM6WM, Trevor, WA6JAU and Mary Jane, N6NVA turned towards the camera when asked to while Vicki was looking the other way. No one got into trouble for not listening to N6KLS at that moment!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Earle, KM6WM, Trevor, WA6JAU and Mary Jane, N6NVA turned towards the camera when asked to while Vicki was looking the other way. No one got into trouble for not listening to N6KLS at that moment!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\" data-medium-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?fit=300%2C169\" data-large-file=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?fit=600%2C338\" class=\"size-large wp-image-345310\" src=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?resize=600%2C338\" alt=\"Earle, KM6WM, Trevor, WA6JAU and Mary Jane, N6NVA turned towards the camera when asked to while Vicki was looking the other way. No one got into trouble for not listening to N6KLS at that moment!\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\" srcset=\"\/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?resize=1024%2C576 1024w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?resize=300%2C169 300w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?resize=768%2C432 768w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?w=1200 1200w, \/archive\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/08\/2015-10-24-09.17.12.jpg?w=1800 1800w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><p id=\"caption-attachment-345310\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Earle, KM6WM, Trevor, WA6JAU and Mary Jane, N6NVA turned towards the camera when asked to while Vicki was looking the other way. No one got into trouble for not listening to N6KLS at that moment!<\/p><\/div>\n<p><strong>It was announced the Contra Costa Repeater Association\u2019s October 26, 2015 Roster would be posted on the following Monday.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 In it you will find our 3 newest members.\u00a0 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>W6MCP, Matt Poertner from Pittsburg, <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>KK6RSL, Ted Reyes from Pittsburg <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>and <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>KK6SQM, Bruce Alcorn from Concord<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>If you\u2019re interested in joining the CCRA, please <a title=\"CCRA Membership Application\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/?page_id=103\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">click here<\/a>.\u00a0 Another opportunity to meet the repeater users is to check into the CCRA Weekly Net on Mondays at 7:35 PM so please check-in!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>It was also announced that if you would like to listen to the repeater you can do so by clicking \u201cBroadcastify\u201d which will take you to the Broadcastify website.\u00a0 This service became available thanks to the time and effort of Mitchell, W8DOD.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Our next breakfast falls 2 days after Thanksgiving.\u00a0 There was a mixed view of should we or should we not get together.\u00a0 Many of our members expressed interest in getting together so plan on being at our next and final year end CCRA breakfast <strong>on November 28th, 2015.\u00a0 It will be at the Legends &amp; Heroes Sports Bar at 9 AM <\/strong>at the Diablo Creek Golf Course at 4050 Port Chicago Highway in North Concord.<br \/>\n<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>We will be cancelling the December 26th breakfast since it is one day after Christmas.\u00a0 We will resume our regular scheduled breakfasts on January 23rd, 2016.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Last but not least it is time to renew your annual membership with the CCRA.\u00a0\u00a0 In the October 26th CCRA roster you will find members names highlighted in yellow.\u00a0 This indicates you are paid up through 2015 and it is time for you to renew your membership.\u00a0 Please send your dues to:<\/strong><\/p>\n<h1><strong>Jan Overacker, KC6ZKS<\/strong><\/h1>\n<h1><strong>CCRA Treasurer<\/strong><\/h1>\n<h1><strong>981 Lexington Way<\/strong><\/h1>\n<h1><strong>Woodland, CA\u00a0\u00a0 95695<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p><strong>We hope everyone has a wonderful Thanksgiving!<\/strong><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Our CCRA breakfast had 20 people show up which was a good turnout. It was announced the Contra Costa Repeater Association\u2019s October 26, 2015 Roster would be posted on the <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"http:\/\/ccra.us\/2015\/10\/27\/ccra-october-24-breakfast-pictures-and-meeting-summary\/\">Continue Reading &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[2],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-1677","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-ccra-news"],"jetpack_featured_media_url":"","jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/p69ory-r3","_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1677","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1677"}],"version-history":[{"count":3,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1677\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":345314,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1677\/revisions\/345314"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1677"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=1677"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/ccra.us\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=1677"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}